List of all Cat Units with the [[Sage Slayer]] ability. These units deal 1.2x damage against [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage Enemies]], take 0.5x damage from Sages, ignore Sages' debuff resistances and are resistant to all debuffs inflicted by Sages, including [[Weaken]], [[Freeze]], [[Knockback]], [[Slow]], [[Warp]], [[Curse]] and [[Drain]]. Effect durations and knockback distance are reduced by 70%.
